      "text": "Static Bloom — rehearsal manager\n\nThe whole product is one path: Calendar → Rehearsal → Song. Two nav destinations only; rehearsals live inside the calendar, setlists inside rehearsals.\n\nEverything here is live: change months, pick a day, book a rehearsal, drag the setlist, transpose the song."
